zl-theme (1.2.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Give the login and lock screen cards a shared raised look (soft shadow,
    gradient and bevel).
  * Style the lock screen password field white to match the login theme.
  * Port the SDDM theme to Qt 6: QtGraphicalEffects is not available to
    sddm-greeter-qt6, so use Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects instead.
  * Use the locale long date format, which Qt 6 dropped from Qt.formatDate.

 -- ZealLab LLC <info@zeallab.com>  Tue, 28 Jul 2026 20:40:00 -0400

